.env
__pycache__/
venv/
server.log
.DS_Store
*.pyc
.vercel
.env*
# ...except the template, which has no secrets and is meant to be committed. Without this
# exception .env* silently swallows it too, and `cp .env.example .env` stops working for
# the next person who clones the repo.
!.env.example

# Node deps: Electron itself (desktop/node_modules -- a full Chromium + Node runtime, ~290MB)
# and electron-builder, used to package the desktop pet. The pattern matches at any depth, so
# one line covers node_modules wherever it appears.
node_modules/
